  "version": "1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Label-11x1in-Long",
    "description": "Long roll label 279.4 x 25.4 mm (11 x 1 in), one per row, designed the way it is read. Too long for a 4 inch print head across: print it with Orientation Landscape in the printer profile. TOP and the thick top edge show which way it came out. Data: Label-11x1in-Long.csv.",
    "author": ""
  },
